NOTE
install-macos.mp4 carries no audio stream at all (one h264 video stream, no
audio), so there is no speech or sound to caption. Its only words are burned
into the picture and stay there for the whole four seconds, so repeating them
here would print the same sentence twice over the frame. These cues describe
the gesture instead, which is the part a still frame does not tell you, and the
track is offered in the captions menu rather than forced on.

